    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the public health law, in relation to requiring translations\nof a patient's rights; and in relation to the posting of information relating\nto the long-term care ombudsman program",
    "basePrintNo": "S4377",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S4377-2021",
